#!/bin/sh
# Runs the mothership CLI for the Omarchy front end: the installed command when there is one,
# else the source checkout this plugin lives in (ui/omarchy/mothership -> the repo root).
if command -v mothership >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  exec mothership "$@"
fi
here=$(dirname "$(readlink -f "$0")")
cd "$here/../../.." 2>/dev/null && [ -d mothership ] && exec python3 -m mothership.cli "$@"
echo "mothership: not installed (no mothership command and no source checkout next to the plugin)" >&2
exit 127
